 * I2C (400 kHz): SDA on GPIO 15, SCL on GPIO 5. Shared by the LSM6DS3 IMU and the VL53L0X ToF sensor.
 * SD card (SPI): CS 4, SCK 18, MOSI 14, MISO 27
 * Motors: M1 on GPIO 19, M2 on GPIO 23, M3 on GPIO 32, M4 on GPIO 25
